@startuml C4-Dynamic-Auth-Login
!include style-zinc.puml

title Dynamic — Auth login (Bearer token)

actor Investor as investor
participant "Portal / Admin" as ui <<ui>>
participant "Java API\nauth module :8801" as auth <<java>>
database "PostgreSQL" as db <<db>>

investor -> ui: 1. Submit email + password
ui -> auth: 2. POST /api/v1/auth/login
auth -> db: 3. Lookup customer credentials
db --> auth: 4. Customer row
auth --> ui: 5. 200 { token, customer }
ui --> investor: 6. Store Bearer token\nfor protected calls

legend right
  |= Role |= Color |
  | Actor | Emerald |
  | <<ui>> | Slate |
  | <<java>> | Blue |
  | <<db>> | Amber |
endlegend

note right of auth
  Protected APIs require
  Authorization: Bearer <token>
end note

@enduml
